# This project installs with bun; bun.lock is the lockfile of record. A stray
# `npm install` regenerates these, and committing one puts Dependabot back on
# the npm ecosystem, whose PRs fail CI's `bun install --frozen-lockfile`.
package-lock.json
docs/package-lock.json

